  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Skit**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Twinkle**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Tyrone**: back after 40 archived shows (1082 days) [5]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Outta My System, You Wanna Freak Out, Slow Slow Tune, Movin Away, The Day Is Coming [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2011-05-31.mk41.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 29 songs; 184 min; rated 3.33/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: Listener describes the audio as an easy EX+, possibly SUP quality capture [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Daniel Martin Moore sang and Ben Sollee played cello during the performance [1]\n- Nine female vocalists joined the band on stage for the concert [1]\n- Kevin Ratterman provided percussion for the majority of the show [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2011-05-31.mk41.flac16**: taped by Brian Porter; source: Schoeps mk41 (DINa/Balcony rail) > kcy > Sonosax SX-M2/LS2 > Sony D50 (24/48) [1]. Also: Raw FLV video file was ripped from a two-day YouTube archive [4]",
